   194	task times: searches, evaluation, and doubling about 1.77 hours (internal review's computation); diagnostics about 0.6
   195	hours (105 evaluations in batches of 10); preparation 0.3 hours; idle tail 0.3 hours = **about 3.0 billed hours, about
   196	1.66 USD**. The benchmark's unit price (0.0625 USD per unit, at its 0.108 USD per core-hour) gives about 2.10 USD; the plan
   197	uses the larger.
